/*
If the U/D color (white or yellow) is on the U or D face,  orientation = 0
If the U/D color is on an F or B face,  orientation = 1
If the U/D color is on an R or L face,  orientation = 2

For U/D layer edges (those containing white or yellow):
If the white/yellow color is on the U or D face  orientation = 0 (correct).
If it’s on a side face (F, B, L, R)  orientation = 1 (flipped).

For middle (Equator) edges (FR, FL, BL, BR):
If the front/back color (Green/Blue) is on F or B  orientation = 0.
If the F/B color is on U, D, L, or R  orientation = 1.
